1
00:00:00,175 --> 00:00:01,255
(Penny:)I did?

2
00:00:01,426 --> 00:00:05,476
(Sheldon:)The photo of the cat
who wants to "Has Cheezburger?"

3
00:00:05,639 --> 00:00:08,309
(Penny:)Oh, come on, everybody loves Lolcats.

4
00:00:08,475 --> 00:00:11,315
(Penny:)They're cute and they can't spell...

5
00:00:11,478 --> 00:00:13,818
...because they're cats.

6
00:00:14,147 --> 00:00:17,277
(Sheldon:)I trusted you with my e-mail address
and you betrayed that trust...

7
00:00:17,442 --> 00:00:20,032
(Sheldon:)...by sending me Internet banality.
Strike one.

8
00:00:21,279 --> 00:00:22,779
(Sheldon:)Touching my food, strike two.

9
00:00:25,283 --> 00:00:28,123
(Leonard:)Don't worry,
they only stay on your record for a year.

10
00:00:29,496 --> 00:00:32,666
(Howard:)You can get them removed early
but you have to take his class.

11
00:00:32,999 --> 00:00:38,049
- Oh, come on, I touched one onion ring.
- And then you put it back.

12
00:00:38,213 --> 00:00:41,883
(Sheldon:)Compromising the integrity
of all the other onion rings.

13
00:00:42,134 --> 00:00:46,134
(Penny:)Oh, honey, the buses don't go
where you live, do they?

14
00:00:48,682 --> 00:00:50,812
Look, I wish I could be more lenient
with you.

15
00:00:50,976 --> 00:00:53,186
(Sheldon:)But since you've become
a permanent member...

16
00:00:53,353 --> 00:00:56,143
...I've to hold you to the same standards
as everybody else.

17
00:00:56,314 --> 00:01:00,024
(Leonard:)Congratulations,
you're officially one of us.

